  "notable_quotes": [
    "Compared with 148° H2TDC, 120° H2IPA does not preserve the pillared-layer motif; it partially replaces ATZ− because the smaller angle disfavors pillared layers.",
    "One-pot synthesis of mixed carboxylate/imidazolate zeolitic MOFs is rarely successful because competing products tend to form.",
    "BUT-27, a 3D zeolite A-type MOF with LTA topology, was synthesized from BUT-25 by post-synthetic linker exchange via single-crystal-to-single-crystal transformation."
